{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011S6oKaM3TEQaPoNjqwmTmZ","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, the final name of the new enum type introduced to replace boolean `isTimestamped`/`isHeadersEnabled` parameters on Dsl*Params constructors as of 2026-02-22 is **`DslStoreFormat`**.\\\\n\\\\nThis is documented in the correspondence around KIP-1285 (DSL Opt-in Support for Header-Aware State Stores). In the email from Alieh Saeedi dated 2026-02-22, she clarifies that after feedback from Lucas Brutschy suggesting the name \\\\\\\"format\\\\\\\" over \\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\", she changed the enum name from the initially proposed `DslStoreType` to **`DslStoreFormat`**. The enum has two values: `DEFAULT` and `HEADERS`.\\\\n\\\\n**Sources:**\\\\n- `/store/mail/2026/02/2026-02-22-mail-c4bfde361f38ca346dffd233-ed6480b7.md` (Alieh's 2026-02-22 response)\\\\n- `/store/kips/KIP-1285/2026-02-23-discuss-KIP-1285-DSL-header-aware-state-stores-a75c98ed.md` (quoting the same correspondence)\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"INDEX.md\\\",\\\"kips/KIP-1285/2026-02-23-discuss-KIP-1285-DSL-header-aware-state-stores-2378b0e1.md\\\",\\\"mail/2026/02/2026-02-22-mail-6ea3402c8bc00ae4fb37dcf5-d5ef6d28.md\\\",\\\"mail/2026/02/2026-02-22-mail-c4bfde361f38ca346dffd233-ed6480b7.md\\\",\\\"kips/KIP-1285/2026-02-23-discuss-KIP-1285-DSL-header-aware-state-stores-a75c98ed.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":25.22,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":2,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":111297,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":21632,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.0650717,\\\"input_tokens\\\":58,\\\"output_tokens\\\":2124}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8f605af7-41e7-437c-af4a-38bdd5fb8a6c","uuid":"eb56ba83-fc80-4bc8-9f79-a8f459dbb76d","timestamp":"2026-09-27T18:50:10.352Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, the final name of the new enum type introduced to replace boolean `isTimestamped`/`isHeadersEnabled` parameters on Dsl*Params constructors as of 2026-02-22 is **`DslStoreFormat`**.\\\\n\\\\nThis is documented in the correspondence around KIP-1285 (DSL Opt-in Support for Header-Aware State Stores). In the email from Alieh Saeedi dated 2026-02-22, she clarifies that after feedback from Lucas Brutschy suggesting the name \\\\\\\"format\\\\\\\" over \\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\", she changed the enum name from the initially proposed `DslStoreType` to **`DslStoreFormat`**. The enum has two values: `DEFAULT` and `HEADERS`.\\\\n\\\\n**Sources:**\\\\n- `/store/mail/2026/02/2026-02-22-mail-c4bfde361f38ca346dffd233-ed6480b7.md` (Alieh's 2026-02-22 response)\\\\n- `/store/kips/KIP-1285/2026-02-23-discuss-KIP-1285-DSL-header-aware-state-stores-a75c98ed.md` (quoting the same correspondence)\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"INDEX.md\\\",\\\"kips/KIP-1285/2026-02-23-discuss-KIP-1285-DSL-header-aware-state-stores-2378b0e1.md\\\",\\\"mail/2026/02/2026-02-22-mail-6ea3402c8bc00ae4fb37dcf5-d5ef6d28.md\\\",\\\"mail/2026/02/2026-02-22-mail-c4bfde361f38ca346dffd233-ed6480b7.md\\\",\\\"kips/KIP-1285/2026-02-23-discuss-KIP-1285-DSL-header-aware-state-stores-a75c98ed.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":25.22,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":2,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":111297,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":21632,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.0650717,\\\"input_tokens\\\":58,\\\"output_tokens\\\":2124}}\"}","_meta":{"fastmcp":{"wrap_result":true}},"structuredContent":{"result":"{\"answer\":\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, the final name of the new enum type introduced to replace boolean `isTimestamped`/`isHeadersEnabled` parameters on Dsl*Params constructors as of 2026-02-22 is **`DslStoreFormat`**.\\n\\nThis is documented in the correspondence around KIP-1285 (DSL Opt-in Support for Header-Aware State Stores). In the email from Alieh Saeedi dated 2026-02-22, she clarifies that after feedback from Lucas Brutschy suggesting the name \\\"format\\\" over \\\"type\\\", she changed the enum name from the initially proposed `DslStoreType` to **`DslStoreFormat`**. The enum has two values: `DEFAULT` and `HEADERS`.\\n\\n**Sources:**\\n- `/store/mail/2026/02/2026-02-22-mail-c4bfde361f38ca346dffd233-ed6480b7.md` (Alieh's 2026-02-22 response)\\n- `/store/kips/KIP-1285/2026-02-23-discuss-KIP-1285-DSL-header-aware-state-stores-a75c98ed.md` (quoting the same correspondence)\",\"error\":null,\"files\":[\"INDEX.md\",\"kips/KIP-1285/2026-02-23-discuss-KIP-1285-DSL-header-aware-state-stores-2378b0e1.md\",\"mail/2026/02/2026-02-22-mail-6ea3402c8bc00ae4fb37dcf5-d5ef6d28.md\",\"mail/2026/02/2026-02-22-mail-c4bfde361f38ca346dffd233-ed6480b7.md\",\"kips/KIP-1285/2026-02-23-discuss-KIP-1285-DSL-header-aware-state-stores-a75c98ed.md\"],\"seconds\":25.22,\"truncated\":false,\"turns\":2,\"usage\":{\"cache_read_tokens\":111297,\"cache_write_tokens\":21632,\"cost_usd\":0.0650717,\"input_tokens\":58,\"output_tokens\":2124}}"}}}
